<script setup>
import {computed,onMounted,ref} from 'vue'
const active=ref('overview'),skills=ref([]),commands=ref([]),search=ref(''),selected=ref(null),family=ref('vue'),project=ref('my-app'),extra=ref(''),generated=ref(''),copied=ref(false),error=ref(''),loading=ref(true)
const families=[['vue','Vue 页面'],['java','Java API'],['build','构建命令'],['skill','运行 Skill'],['prompt','导出 Prompt']]
const filtered= computed(()=>skills.value.filter(s=>(s.name+s.description+s.tags).toLowerCase().includes(search.value.toLowerCase())))
async function api(path,opt){const r=await fetch('/api/'+path,{headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},...opt});if(!r.ok)throw new Error((await r.json().catch(()=>({}))).message||'请求失败');return r.json()}
async function load(){try{[skills.value,commands.value]=await Promise.all([api('skills'),api('commands')])}catch(e){error.value=e.message}finally{loading.value=false}}
async function preview(){try{generated.value=(await api('commands/preview',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({family:family.value,project:project.value,extra:extra.value,skill:selected.value?.id})})).command;error.value=''}catch(e){error.value=e.message}}
async function copyCommand(){await navigator.clipboard?.writeText(generated.value);copied.value=true;setTimeout(()=>copied.value=false,1500)}
function go(x){active.value=x;selected.value=null;error.value=''}
onMounted(load)
</script>
<template><div class="app"><aside><div class="logo"><span>✦</span><div><b>AI / HUB</b><small>LOCAL INTELLIGENCE</small></div></div><div class="side-label">AI WORKSPACE <i>LOCAL</i></div><nav><button :class="{on:active==='overview'}" @click="go('overview')">◈ <span>工作台</span></button><button :class="{on:active==='cli'}" @click="go('cli')">⌘ <span>CLI 工具箱</span><em>{{commands.length}}</em></button><button :class="{on:active==='skills'}" @click="go('skills')">✳ <span>Skill 技能库</span><em>{{skills.length}}</em></button><button :class="{on:active==='prompt'}" @click="go('prompt')">▤ <span>Prompt 工作台</span></button></nav><div class="side-bottom"><strong>安全的本地起点</strong><p>不自动调用外部模型。命令和技能先预览，再由你决定是否执行。</p><small>Vue 3 · Java 21</small></div></aside><main><header><span>AI 工作空间 <b>/</b> {{active==='overview'?'总览':active==='cli'?'CLI 工具箱':active==='skills'?'Skill 技能库':'Prompt 工作台'}}</span><div><i class="live"></i>本机运行 <button class="avatar">AI</button></div></header><section v-if="error" class="alert">{{error}} <button @click="error=''">×</button></section><section v-if="loading" class="loading">正在加载 AI 工具箱…</section><template v-else><section v-if="active==='overview'" class="page"><div class="hero"><div><label>AI WORKSPACE / 2026</label><h1>把想法变成<br><b>可以执行的下一步。</b></h1><p>CLI 命令、Skill 技能和 Prompt 模板，统一收进一个本机工作台。</p><button class="hero-btn" @click="go('cli')">开始生成命令 <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="orb"><span>✦</span><i>AI</i><small>BUILD · THINK · SHIP</small></div></div><div class="stats"><article><small>可用 Skills</small><strong>{{skills.length}}</strong><span>覆盖研发、写作与研究</span></article><article><small>CLI 模板</small><strong>{{commands.length}}</strong><span>可复制、可二次编辑</span></article><article><small>工作模式</small><strong>03</strong><span>CLI · Skill · Prompt</span></article></div><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><label>QUICK START</label><h2>今天要做什么？</h2></div></div><button class="quick" @click="go('cli')"><b>⌘</b><span><strong>生成一条 CLI 命令</strong><small>初始化项目、构建、运行技能</small></span><i>→</i></button><button class="quick" @click="go('skills')"><b>✳</b><span><strong>挑一个 Skill 开始</strong><small>用结构化步骤降低重复劳动</small></span><i>→</i></button><button class="quick" @click="go('prompt')"><b>▤</b><span><strong>整理一份 Prompt</strong><small>把需求变成可复用的工作说明</small></span><i>→</i></button></div><div class="panel philosophy"><label>LOCAL-FIRST AI</label><h2>AI 不只是聊天。</h2><p>它也可以是一个命令、一套检查清单、一份技能说明，或者一个帮你把工作拆清楚的结构化入口。</p><div class="quote">“先把下一步做得清楚，再让模型帮你做得更快。”</div></div></div></section><section v-else-if="active==='cli'" class="page"><div class="page-title"><div><label>AI / CLI BUILDER</label><h1>CLI 工具箱<span>.</span></h1><p>选择一个模板，生成可以检查、复制和手动执行的命令。</p></div></div><div class="cli-layout"><div class="panel form"><h2>命令生成器</h2><label>命令类型</label><div class="choice"><button v-for="x in families" :class="{picked:family===x[0]}" @click="family=x[0];preview()">{{x[1]}}</button></div><label>项目或参数</label><input v-model="project" placeholder="my-app" @input="preview"><label>额外参数 <small>可选</small></label><input v-model="extra" placeholder="例如 --mode production" @input="preview"><button class="primary" @click="preview">生成命令</button></div><div class="panel terminal"><div class="terminal-top"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>aihub / command-preview</small></div><div class="terminal-body"><div class="prompt">$ <span>{{generated||'选择左侧模板开始生成'}}</span></div><p>仅生成预览，不会自动执行。请确认目录、参数和依赖后再复制到终端。</p><button v-if="generated" class="copy" @click="copyCommand">{{copied?'已复制 ✓':'复制命令'}}</button></div></div></div><div class="command-list"><div v-for="c in commands" :key="c.name" class="command-row"><b>{{c.name}}</b><code>{{c.command}}</code><small>{{c.note}}</small></div></div></section><section v-else-if="active==='skills'" class="page"><div class="page-title"><div><label>AI / SKILL LIBRARY</label><h1>Skill 技能库<span>.</span></h1><p>每一个技能都是一条可复用的工作路径，而不是一句玄学提示词。</p></div><input class="search" v-model="search" placeholder="搜索技能、标签或用途…"></div><div class="skill-grid"><article v-for="s in filtered" :key="s.id" class="skill-card" @click="selected=s"><div class="skill-icon">✳</div><div class="skill-level">难度 {{s.level}}</div><h2>{{s.name}}</h2><p>{{s.description}}</p><small>{{s.tags}}</small><button>查看步骤 ↗</button></article></div><div v-if="selected" class="overlay" @click.self="selected=null"><aside class="drawer"><button class="close" @click="selected=null">×</button><label>SKILL / {{selected.id}}</label><h2>{{selected.name}}</h2><p>{{selected.description}}</p><h3>建议执行路径</h3><ol><li v-for="step in selected.steps" :key="step">{{step}}</li></ol><button class="primary" @click="go('cli');family='skill';preview()">用它生成命令</button></aside></div></section><section v-else class="page"><div class="page-title"><div><label>AI / PROMPT DESK</label><h1>Prompt 工作台<span>.</span></h1><p>把一次性需求整理成下一次还能复用的工作说明。</p></div></div><div class="prompt-layout"><div class="panel prompt-editor"><div class="editor-tabs"><b>工作说明</b><span>Markdown</span></div><textarea placeholder="例如：请帮我把这个业务需求拆成页面、接口、数据结构和测试清单…"></textarea><div class="editor-foot"><span>建议包含：角色 · 目标 · 背景 · 约束 · 输出格式</span><button class="primary" @click="go('cli');family='prompt';preview()">导出为 CLI</button></div></div><div class="panel prompt-tips"><label>结构化提示</label><h2>好 Prompt 的 5 个部件</h2><div v-for="(x,i) in ['角色：你希望 AI 以谁的身份工作？','目标：最终要交付什么？','背景：哪些信息不能丢？','约束：哪些事情不能做？','格式：结果要如何呈现？']" :key="x"><b>0{{i+1}}</b><span>{{x}}</span></div></div></div></section></template><footer>AI-HUB · 本机单用户 AI 工作台 <span>命令需人工确认 · 不会自动执行外部操作</span></footer></main></div></template>